<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Milne-Edwards & Haime (1848) / Chindapol et al. (2013) Scleractinian coral calice septal insertion & advection-diffusion morphogenesis (Caryophyllia (Caryophyllia) quadragenaria & Pocillopora verrucosa (Scleractinia stony corals))",
        "Milne-Edwards & Haime (1848) / Chindapol et al. (2013) Scleractinian coral calice septal insertion & advection-diffusion morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Caryophyllia (Caryophyllia) quadragenaria & Pocillopora verrucosa (Scleractinia stony corals) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2013-thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Caryophyllia (Caryophyllia) quadragenaria & Pocillopora verrucosa (Scleractinia stony corals) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 51.8/100, audit 2026-10-19-coral-calice-septa-insertion-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2013-thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion.py> ;
    schema:about "Caryophyllia (Caryophyllia) quadragenaria & Pocillopora verrucosa (Scleractinia stony corals)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2013-thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion.py; output: docs/media/coral_calice_septa_insertion_comparison.png; organism: Caryophyllia (Caryophyllia) quadragenaria & Pocillopora verrucosa (Scleractinia stony corals); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 838f1452734ffec4b95f30098de1ca90f5c6e961cce22175354f682fa6865b61; artifact_sha256: 78be82bf5573c83c86c2ffc4b604d12fed23d472826afae1554dd32bee919d17; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/coral_calice_septa_insertion/coral_calice_septa_insertion_reference.json=9984d41d12285bd0..., datasets/coral_calice_septa_insertion/scleractinian_coral_septa_specimen.jpg=904035c936843361..., datasets/coral_calice_septa_insertion/scout_manifest.json=325761c7cb0d58db...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-662-04339-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1127/zdgg/21/1869/647>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1002849>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3897/zookeys.227.3612>,
        <https://doi.org/10.5962/bhl.title.11574> ;
